#31088
Echo Landing~
The landing shelf is scored ice. Exhaust has melted it and the night
has frozen it again, so the pad is a sheet of ridges. A trench cut into
the snow runs toward the ridge. A rebel in a gray parka waves ships in
with a pair of light sticks.
~
